Use temporary HOME, XDG directories, fake executables, and mocked command paths.

Test at minimum:

- username other than freezer
- UID other than 1000
- HOME containing spaces
- missing XDG variables
- missing DISPLAY
- Wayland session warning
- one monitor
- three monitors
- shader name containing spaces
- invalid shader
